    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "D4717B8263D1451D",
      "text": "¡Síii!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "D471788263D14004",
      "text": "Supongo...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "743CA20901C56D68",
      "text": "¡Míral[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa qué mon[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! Con sinceridad, ¡así me gusta![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "48745F4E027847FE",
      "text": "¡Menuda desgana me trae [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]ella chaval[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a! ¡Ja, ja, ja!\\nUn poco más de entusiasmo no te vendría mal.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "743CA90901C5794D",
      "text": "En fin, supongo que me habrás llamado para que\\nanime un poco el cotarro en esta academia, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "743CA80901C5779A",
      "text": "¡Pues eso se me da de cine! ¡Nadie como la Caye\\npara este trabajillo![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "78B3E31FD517400E",
      "text": "La primera vez que pisé esta academia fue para\\nacompañar a la superjefa suprema.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "78B3E41FD51741C1",
      "text": "Puede que te parezca doña perfecta, pero, con\\nlo despistada que es, no se la puede dejar sola.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "416A704DF61BF9C0",
      "text": "¡Quién lo hubiera dicho!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "416A734DF61BFED9",
      "text": "Formáis buen equipo",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "78B3E11FD5173CA8",
      "text": "¡Te recuerdo que se le olvidó darle aquel disco\\nraro a la tal Brie, por ejemplo! ¡Menuda cabeza![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "30E45317167C4B3E",
      "text": "¡Pues claro, anda que no ha llovido ni na desde\\nque nos conocimos![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "78B3E21FD5173E5B",
      "text": "¿Sabes qué? A veces incluso viene a trabajar con\\nsu Glimmet enmarañado en el pelo, tan pancha...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "78B3E71FD51746DA",
      "text": "Ah, pero esto que se quede entre nosotr[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas, ¿eh?\\c\\n¡Que como se entere de que voy soltando estas\\ncosas por ahí, me cruje![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "78B3E81FD517488D",
      "text": "Será nuestro pequeño secreto, así entre tú y yo.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "770B991AADACD51F",
      "text": "La verdad es que me divierto dando charlas a la\\nchavalada, pero termino con el cerebro frito.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "770B981AADACD36C",
      "text": "Es que cuando estoy currando me tengo que\\nponer hiperseria y tal...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "770B9B1AADACD885",
      "text": "Hasta me pongo gafas para parecer interesante.\\nYa ves tú, ¡si ni siquiera están graduadas![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "770B9A1AADACD6D2",
      "text": "Ahora que lo pienso, tú ya viste a la Caye seria\\nen todo su esplendor durante la entrevista.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "770B951AADACCE53",
      "text": "Dime, ¿a cuál prefieres? ¿A la Caye de siempre\\no a la Caye seria?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "6813464A803E76FB",
      "text": "A la de siempre",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "6813474A803E78AE",
      "text": "A la seria",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "770B941AADACCCA0",
      "text": "¡Qué me dices! Pues, entonces, cuando esté\\ndelante de ti, voy a relajarme y a ser yo misma,\\r\\naunque esté currando.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "F5796B551C9FEDA6",
      "text": "¡No me diga! En ese caso, cuando me encuentre\\ndelante de usted, procuraré comportarme formal\\r\\ny educadamente, como guste.\\c\\n¡Y un jamón, que te lo has creído![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "770B971AADACD1B9",
      "text": "Pero tomo nota, que no quiero darle mal rollo\\na la gente cuando hablo, ¿sabes?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "535B9E15484E2CB9",
      "text": "Oye, me da la impresión de que hemos hablado\\nun montón últimamente, ¿que no?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "535B9D15484E2B06",
      "text": "Ahora que ya nos conocemos a fondo, ¿por qué\\nno lo celebramos como es debido?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "535B9C15484E2953",
      "text": "¡Buah, se me acaba de encender la bombilla!\\n¿Y si intercambiamos Pokémon?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "535B9B15484E27A0",
      "text": "¡Venga, al turrón! Yo te ofrezco a mi Wooper.\\n¿Y tú? ¿Qué tienes para mí?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_zimen_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "535BA215484E3385",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]¡[VAR 0x0101(0001)] me mola! Voy a mimarlo\\ncomo si\\r\\nno hubiera un mañana.\\c\\nY ni se te ocurra olvidarte de este día, ¿vale?\\nQue, si no, ¡me cabreo![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
